    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "common_2020_mushi_020_mushi_03",
      "hash64": "83DEAD0936B4C5CC",
      "text": "Je me demande si tu avais visité d’autres Arènes\\navant de visiter la mienne, d’ailleurs.[VAR 0x0114(0016)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0016"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "common_2020_mushi_020_mushi_04",
      "hash64": "83DEAC0936B4C419",
      "text": "Comme mon Arène est assez proche\\nde l’école, c’est souvent la première que\\r\\nles Dresseurs et les Dresseuses visitent.[VAR 0x0114(0016)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 74,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 119,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0016"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "common_2020_mushi_020_mushi_05",
      "hash64": "83DEAB0936B4C266",
      "text": "C’est d’ailleurs pour ça que la Cheffe\\nme demande d’y aller tout doux avec eux.[VAR 0x0114(0016)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 79,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0016"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "common_2020_mushi_020_mushi_06",
      "hash64": "83DEAA0936B4C0B3",
      "text": "Mais ça me fait de la peine pour mes petits\\nPokémon Insecte chéris, qui se retrouvent\\r\\nà perdre à chaque fois...[VAR 0x0114(0016)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 114,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0016"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "common_2020_mushi_020_mushi_07",
      "hash64": "83DEA90936B4BF00",
      "text": "Au moins, cette fois, je vais pouvoir arrêter de\\nmarcher sur des œufs et révéler mon véritable\\r\\npotentiel ! Hé hé ![VAR 0x0114(0016)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 117,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0016"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "common_2020_mushi_020_mushi_08",
      "hash64": "83DEB80936B4D87D",
      "text": "Maintenant, si tu me le permets...\\nJe vais t’aplatir... comme une crêpe ![VAR 0x0114(0016)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 73,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0016"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "common_2020_mushi_020_mushi_09",
      "hash64": "83DEB70936B4D6CA",
      "text": "Quel talent ! Tu n’as rien à envier à la Cheffe ![VAR 0x0114(0016)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 49,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0016"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "common_2020_mushi_020_mushi_10",
      "hash64": "83DBAA0936B28ADC",
      "text": "J’ai beau avoir perdu, cela fait un bien fou\\nde mettre toutes ses forces dans un combat ![VAR 0x0114(0016)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0016"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "common_2020_mushi_020_mushi_11",
      "hash64": "83DBAB0936B28C8F",
      "text": "Finalement, cela ne profite peut-être à personne\\nque j’y aille tout doux avec mes adversaires...[VAR 0x0114(0016)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 96,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0016"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "common_2020_mushi_020_mushi_12",
      "hash64": "83DBAC0936B28E42",
      "text": "Après tout, Kombu, mon professeur de cuisine,\\nm’avait dit de mettre un peu plus de moi-même\\r\\ndans mes gâteaux, et c’est ce que j’ai fait ![VAR 0x0114(0016)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 140,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0016"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "common_2020_mushi_020_mushi_13",
      "hash64": "83DBAD0936B28FF5",
      "text": "Je crois que je devrais aussi essayer de mettre\\nplus de moi-même dans mes combats.[VAR 0x0114(0016)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0016"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "common_2020_mushi_020_mushi_14",
      "hash64": "83DBA60936B28410",
      "text": "Et si les gens se plaignent que mon Arène est\\ndevenue trop difficile...\\c\\nJe leur dirai que j’ai simplement ajouté\\nun soupçon d’amertume ! ♪[VAR 0x0114(0016)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
